WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:08.620
Take a backup now, download it, schedule the nightly copy and learn how a backup is restored.

2
00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:14.630
Backups are in Settings. Every night a checked, compressed copy of everything is kept.

3
00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:20.890
Here you see when the last copy was taken and how big it is.

4
00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:32.060
Back up now takes a copy straight away, for example before a big change.

5
00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:38.640
The copies kept on the server, newest first. Download one to keep it somewhere safe.

6
00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:45.610
The schedule: the hour of the nightly copy and how many days of copies to keep.

7
00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:52.860
You can also have each night's copy emailed to an address you control.

8
00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:55.970
Save.

9
00:00:55.970 --> 00:01:06.920
How to restore explains, step by step, how to bring a copy back. It replaces everything, so do it with care.

10
00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:12.040
For a copy away from this server, connect off-site storage under Integrations.
